sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (browser)
    participant FE as Vue SPA
    participant API as Fastify /api/v1
    participant TC as tenant-context (ALS)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (Prisma)
    participant RT as Socket.IO

    U->>FE: Log in (email/phone + password)
    FE->>API: POST /auth/login
    API->>DB: bcrypt compare, resolve orgId
    API-->>FE: access JWT (15m) + refresh token (rotating)
    FE->>RT: connect (auth: {token})
    RT->>RT: verify JWT at handshake, join org:<orgId> room

    Note over FE,API: 15 minutes later - access token expires
    FE->>API: Any request with expired JWT
    API-->>FE: 401
    FE->>API: POST /auth/refresh (single-flight, cross-tab locked)
    API->>DB: rotate refresh token, detect reuse if any
    API-->>FE: new access JWT + new refresh token
    FE->>API: Retry original request (once)

    Note over RT: Socket also disconnects on expiry
    RT-->>FE: disconnect (reason: io server disconnect)
    FE->>FE: healAuth() awaits same single-flight refresh
    FE->>RT: reconnect with fresh token
    RT-->>FE: onReconnect(downMs) - composable refetches missed data

    API->>TC: enterTenantContext({orgId, userId, role})
    API->>DB: query via Prisma (tenant-guard checks org-scoped models)
    DB-->>API: rows
    API-->>FE: JSON response
</content>
